    "body": "As @annevk mentioned in IRC, it turns out we need a two-step algorithm. Step 1: switch on image. (Then include this `<dl>` with all the validation steps.) Step 2: return good (since all the validation steps passed).\r\n\r\nWith your PR right now, most of the time nothing gets returned from the algorithm.\r\n\r\n(An alternate formulation would be to add \"Otherwise, return good\" to every `<dd>`. Maybe that would be clearer? What do you think?)",
